      "access": [
        "Any MCP client of the server may call every tool; no tool checks the caller.",
        "In process, the client is whoever started zazzle-csharp-indexer serve; through the daemon, only the socket's owner can connect (mode 0600), whether serve or zazzled.",
        "Every root must be inside a git work tree (Root.Parse), and read and search resolve paths inside the root.",
        "run is limited to a read-only allowlist unless the user sets run.unrestricted or ZAZZLE_INDEXER_RUN_UNRESTRICTED=1."
